{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "2650b393ecd293a28731dfb2ed0e1053a883c8333b0e6dccbe069f2dc12e419e", "ja": "ザクロの実", "zh": "石榴果实", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "8eec6f649be50c844bac9316e7183b71942a19796bfc860e104b7e332f6e7c39", "ja": "神降ろし後、やけに明るく快活な凛音亞を\n心配する永混。深淵海はそれを、神降ろしに\nよって人の体や心に影響が現れたと言う。\n永混の体には、不思議なアザが現れていた。\nその帰り道、深淵海は何者かに襲われる。", "zh": "神降仪式结束后，永混对凛音亞异常开朗活泼的状态感到担忧。深淵海说，这是神降仪式对人的身体和心灵产生了影响。永混的身上出现了奇异的淤青。在回去的路上，深淵海遭到了不明身份者的袭击。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_03_1000_039kon", "source_sha256": "f091ab9fbafa3d28fa6142731b660eaeb3b3138b6b25e7c0c42d75bbdf7d697b", "ja": "よいしょっと……。\nふう。雪かきはこんなものかしら。", "zh": "嘿咻……。\n呼。铲雪就做到这种程度吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_03_1001_037nao", "source_sha256": "598c0920394953ff1e79177422fdd7ecd4d4aa8b508ea2c8f1607c72b0df6325", "ja": "凛音亞！？　体が弱いのに、雪かきなんて……！\n力仕事は、いつもどおり私がやるから！", "zh": "凛音亚！？明明身体不好，怎么还去铲雪……！\n体力活还是一如既往地交给我来做吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_03_1002_039kon", "source_sha256": "8eaf869956f40efb9d1c410638a57f26bdf9b8141bce72aa9cb6995e482b992d", "ja": "平気よ、もう終わっちゃったもの。それに、\n厄災が鎮まってから、とっても元気なのよ、私！", "zh": "没事的啦，都已经铲完了嘛。而且，\n自从灾祸平息之后，我可是精神得很呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_03_1003_037nao", "source_sha256": "a4e20862e4bc59283b327d0efa048120847bcba20f8dbf249f884b5cb2edca1d", "ja": "そうなんだ……。\nでも、無理はしないで。約束だよ。", "zh": "这样啊……。\n不过，别勉强自己。说好了哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_03_1004_039kon", "source_sha256": "6ac51e6d29d0426a89e51a7bdf9ed649427bc2b737fcd3717f829486b0a4a215", "ja": "ええ、わかってる。\n永混は本当に心配性ね！", "zh": "嗯，我知道。永混你真是爱操心啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_03_1005_037nao", "source_sha256": "9cc56a6215ea6a329d03932fba5c7e1a77e1f1e88a2465abad843f006b52bfe4", "ja": "あんなに病弱だった凛音亞が……\nこれも、神降ろしの影響……？", "zh": "曾经那么体弱多病的凛音亚居然……\n这也是降神的影响吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_03_1006_009rit", "source_sha256": "5c81a3df26984650afe66e1586a35fe7de3aff72c30583b6bef51084bfc71b07", "ja": "『神降ろし』によって『厄災』が終わり、人の体や\n心に影響が現れたという事かい？　実に興味深いね。", "zh": "是『神降り』结束了『灾厄』，并对人的身体和心灵产生了影响吗？真是非常有意思呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_03_1007_037nao", "source_sha256": "820d1fbe91cec23179ee3947fbaa2d9fd77223ac509ef45c1a21032544cbda2a", "ja": "貴方は確か、学者の……。", "zh": "您就是那位，我记得……学者……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_03_1008_009rit", "source_sha256": "55b759d9e8f71e7791730ad011761510cbe935d2e78af67bcc2e7c8fe14f1266", "ja": "深淵海だ、永混。君の話、是非もう少し\n詳しく聞かせてもらえないか？", "zh": "是深渊海，永混。你的事情，能否再详细讲给我听听？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_03_1009_009rit", "source_sha256": "7d015a26d5971d251792f9dd651a08868c8b746a0348174b9287067904754168", "ja": "神降ろし以降、気分は？　体調に変化は？\n少しでも変わったことがあれば、教えて欲しい。", "zh": "神降仪式之后，感觉怎么样？身体状况有没有什么变化？哪怕有一点点不同寻常的地方，都请告诉我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_03_1010_037nao", "source_sha256": "2aeea75339fb50ee8b129a3705674e8c5ad5d4fac288d83fd8decfd005ce3836", "ja": "私自身は、何も。\n変わったことといえば……あ、このアザくらい……？", "zh": "我自己倒是没什么。要说有变化的话……啊，大概就是这个伤痕……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_03_1011_009rit", "source_sha256": "3d374776a35a8487c930ffeb6d5f6500ce9676ea2820802abca26e152095aa05", "ja": "これは……！\n永混、このアザはいつから！？", "zh": "这……！\n永绀，这块淤青是什么时候出现的！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_03_1012_037nao", "source_sha256": "b17389b05aab01b36c49d7fd706fa9bd1283cfe52fc44e1cbae771c22a6d64ea", "ja": "儀式の後だと思います。それまではなかったので。\n痛みとかはないんですけど、消えなくて……。", "zh": "我想是在仪式之后。因为在那之前还没有。\n虽然不疼，但就是消不掉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_03_1013_009rit", "source_sha256": "3a6903791492229ee9a1384e3eaa5866a9742ab6d98363c3e5d1d62737fadfd0", "ja": "この模様……間違いない！　早速帰って……\nああ、なんという事だ！　君、邪魔をしたね！", "zh": "这个图案……不会错！赶紧回去……\n\n啊，怎么会这样！你打扰到我了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_03_1014_se", "source_sha256": "1af56fd1311d04ad31140cb6629ef2b97217d8ba40d680294b20aa985bc258bd", "ja": "ドタドタドタ、……バタン！", "zh": "咚咚咚……砰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_03_1015_039kon", "source_sha256": "4d390dd79bb7939ac941a92de2acc01e9d5d9850d9c12e4cf16b61b08df77b6e", "ja": "あら？　お茶を淹れてきたのに、帰っちゃったの？\n深淵海先生って、お忙しい方なのね。", "zh": "哎呀？我特地泡了茶过来，已经回去了吗？\n深渊海老师还真是个大忙人呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_03_1017_039kon", "source_sha256": "231b5f451cb824a1b5b2fa6fe381374b57fba9dfc977bc28f33046d02ae25d28", "ja": "あ、そうそう。深淵海先生からお土産を頂いたの。\nみんなで食べましょう。", "zh": "啊，对了。深渊海先生还送了我伴手礼。\n大家一起吃吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_03_1019_037nao", "source_sha256": "c05d4701fa2680fccbecbab42afd29ca9ab312db209559ea2785df3590f3fabb", "ja": "お土産って……これ、ザクロの実？\n凛音亞、アレルギーがあるんじゃ……。", "zh": "伴手礼……这是石榴吗？\n凛音亚不是对石榴过敏吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_03_1020_039kon", "source_sha256": "b3a2921bc1a6cda2b648e938e1fd21573c6f27768c213296df448722f72c9d10", "ja": "え？　……ああ、そうだったわね。\nでも、大丈夫。もう平気なの。", "zh": "诶？……啊，原来是这样啊。\n不过，没关系。已经没事了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_03_1021_039kon", "source_sha256": "6dac482a953c7ab8f87aedc3c6e00f18df10ca2b3e0a9ad297f0c54058dee30d", "ja": "食べられないと思っていたものが、そうではないと\nわかったからかしら。これ、とっても美味しいわ……。", "zh": "也许是因为发现原以为吃不了的东西，其实并不是那样吧。这道菜真的很好吃……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_03_1023_009rit", "source_sha256": "1699b732278c06d4ccd4b22f5c6bd4563791d9ff27726c3faab754b5e2502f04", "ja": "やはり、やはり私の推測は正しかった……\n間違っていなかったんだ！", "zh": "果然，果然我的推测是正确的……\n没有错！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_03_1024_009rit", "source_sha256": "e7857e6a25b02672c5d95eb86a147e1be6d9e4fb8beba656213a23a6a106ba48", "ja": "あとは、あれが\n『彼の者』だと証明さえ出来れば……！", "zh": "剩下的，只要能证明\n那个就是『那个人』的话……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_03_1025_se", "source_sha256": "10af28091babb9e382d8ffbed5bfeb4242b5fd12325cad7b2a39519e2e66e0fb", "ja": "ビュウッ……！", "zh": "呼——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_03_1026_009rit", "source_sha256": "b7183541791383c457296d2bb18c429ed855f9be2edc012c9d6536461566eb56", "ja": "！？　なんだ、突然……！？", "zh": "！？怎么回事，突然……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_03_1027_040tam", "source_sha256": "5928eaec3c05d6961ad86049c66a1fd57e032aa78c0926f3eaa712c7e2fde7b3", "ja": "それ以上はダメだよ、余所者さん……。", "zh": "再继续下去可不行哦，外乡人……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_03_1028_009rit", "source_sha256": "5d2040d6fcbbed8dfee3df077fd33d4c2168cdbabbbd7cad5552438615c50fef", "ja": "お前は……！！？", "zh": "你是……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_03_1029_035hin", "source_sha256": "82528002ae1c1ce038cfb09df622408fb45a00a0d642b592d20583c37daa96df", "ja": "深淵海先生、遅すぎる……永混の家に行くだけなら、\nこんなに時間はかからないはずなのに。", "zh": "深渊海老师，太慢了……明明只是去永混家，按理说不该花这么长时间才对。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_03_1030_035hin", "source_sha256": "8d44f629f9719e7e93530d73f92deeeacb9056f25c92d5fd593fa78d8d990f90", "ja": "先生！　深淵海先生！\nいたら返事を……あっ！？", "zh": "老师！深渊海老师！如果在的话请回答……啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_03_1031_035hin", "source_sha256": "1a61e55e9e95ec887b0cd7dcdcd29d75c09744578afdcba84b2175a33dd79056", "ja": "深淵海先生！　一体何が……！", "zh": "深渊海老师！究竟发生什么事了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_03_1032_009rit", "source_sha256": "fd0eb601b02c680f848801f4ea8b4743ed4e0155e4088d67f7d2b906d85f23da", "ja": "厄災は……終わらない……。\nもう、すぐそこまで……。", "zh": "灾厄……不会结束……。\n已经……近在咫尺了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_03_1033_035hin", "source_sha256": "1341a808b7439b62e3028ac9e6c10b64ca1e30786c228d7425b246339a5951e4", "ja": "厄災が……終わらない……？", "zh": "厄灾……不会结束……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
